"Questors get warning boxes from Davrar when they say forbidden truths about its nature."
"Davrar sanctions Questors who speak forbidden truths; they fear being punished by Davrar."
"A Questor who gets no warning takes it that Davrar agrees the secret may be shared."
"Questors read their interface with flicking eyes, even while riding or in debate."
"A Questor can tap the air to send a blue box to another person."
"Anyone can privately ask Davrar a question and get an answer only they see."
"Davrar answers whether a proposal could work at all, yes or no."
"Davrar supplies rules on request, such as confirming a war's ban ends with the war."
"Notifications of Questor kills let the killer claim and verify those kills."
"Later, Sarah confirmed her kill on Badud from a notification."
"Later a person was newly christened [Shield of Hope]; bracketed titles come from Davrar."
